B.c2y=new A.fP(B.kW,"Silent Reception & Noise Help Button","Study in complete peace. Discreetly alert reception about noise, AC temperature, Wi-Fi issues, or desk hygiene without leaving your seat or causing a disturbance.","Quiet Study","volume_off","/student/feedback","Explore Help Desk")
