B.c2J=new A.fP(B.qF,"Historical Bulk Admission Date Customization & Cycle Alignment","Easily backdate student joining dates during bulk CSV import or 1-tap adjust dates in student profiles. Subscriptions automatically align with month-end or exact 30-day cycles with full audit trail.","Bulk Admissions & Dates","history_edu","/admin/students","Student Directory")
